        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 13:16",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "But he repented not, neither his fair sons nor daughters; neither the fair sons and daughters of Cohor; neither the fair sons and daughters of Corihor; and in fine, there were none of the fair sons and daughters upon the face of the whole earth who repented of their sins.",
